-2.0 15.9994 8.0  'O '   ! Q (O)
4.0  47.9    22.0 'Ti'   ! Q (B)  --> (Ti type 3)
1.0  22.9898 11.0 'Na'   ! Q (Na)
4.0  91.22   40.0 'Zr'   ! Q (Zr)
3.0  26.9815 13.0 'Al'   ! Q (Al)
2.0  40.078  20.0 'Ca'   ! Q (Ca)
