1 2  942.2 0.3479 0.0 0.9 1.0	! Si-O  --> (Ti type 2)
2 2 22764.0 0.149 32.8 1.1 1.3  	! O-O
2 3  942.2 0.3479 0.0 0.9 1.0	! O-B  --> Ti type 3
2 5  1936.9 0.3440 0.0 0.9 1.0	! O-Zr
